  "details": "Box-projected reflection probes have always been forcefully disabled on Android/Quest. While this made sense when targeting Quest 1, on Quest 2 and 3 the performance impact is minimal.\n\nSome popular shaders like z3y's Graphlit and orels1's Unity shaders implement box-projected reflections manually to display them on Android. It would be much more convenient for world and shader developers if they didn't have to rely on workarounds.",
